title: >-
  Replication package for "Optimizing Heterogeneous UAV Cooperation in
  Counter-Ballistic Missile Kill Chains: A MILP Approach with Design of
  Experiments"
message: >-
  If you use this software or the data it produces, please cite both the
  software (this record) and the accompanying paper.
